Subject: [PATCH 1/2] [megatron] feat: project LM head only for response tokens

Select loss-bearing predictor rows before unfused vocabulary projection or fused linear log-probability and entropy computation. Preserve TP, SP, CP, and PP semantics and restore scalar outputs to the existing token layout.

